      "releaseNotes": "Get 45 FREE 6x4 photo prints every month!\n\n• This release includes bug fixes and improvements\n\nYour suggestions and comments help make FreePrints even better, and we truly appreciate them! Keep sending your feedback to supportUK@freeprintsapp.com.",
